{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2021-10-18 08:00:00', 'title': 'WALGREENS FLU INDEX SHOWS FLU ACTIVITY IS UP 23 PERCENT COMPARED TO LAST FLU SEASON AS PEOPLE RETURN TO MORE IN-PERSON ACTIVITIES', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY WALGREENS LAUNCHES ITS WALGREENS FLU INDEX® FOR THE 2021-2022 SEASON TO HELP COMMUNITIES TRACK FLU ACTIVITY IN THEIR AREA AND SERVE AS A REMINDER TO GET AN ANNUAL FLU SHOT. RETURNING FOR ITS EIGHTH SEASON, THE WALGREENS FLU INDEX SHOWS THAT TO DATE, OVERALL FLU ACTIVITY IS 23% HIGHER NATIONWIDE WHEN COMPARED TO THE 2020-2021 FLU SEASON. “THE WALGREENS FLU INDEX SHOWS HIGHER FLU ACTIVITY TO DATE THAN WHAT WE SAW LAST YEAR DURING THIS SAME TIME, WHEN WE SAW'}